WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:19.515
"I can find the way home," Tom said.

2
00:00:19.516 --> 00:00:30.545
He sniffed the ground. "Follow me."

3
00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:35.984
Moppet and Mittens followed Tom.

4
00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:46.560
They went back through town.

5
00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:48.892
"Look!" Moppet said.

6
00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:51.514
She stopped at a shop window.

7
00:00:51.515 --> 00:00:55.049
"I see cakes!"

8
00:00:55.050 --> 00:01:03.211
"Mmm!" Tom said. "I see cookies."

9
00:01:03.212 --> 00:01:06.628
The kittens looked in another shop window.

10
00:01:06.629 --> 00:01:19.119
They saw some vegetables.

11
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:24.633
They smelled fish.

12
00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:27.892
"I'm hungry," Tom said.

13
00:01:27.893 --> 00:01:31.744
"Me too," Moppet said.

14
00:01:31.745 --> 00:01:35.384
"We have to go home," Mittens said.

15
00:01:35.385 --> 00:01:42.069
Then the shop door flew open.

16
00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:44.584
Tom dashed inside.

17
00:01:44.585 --> 00:01:53.026
His sisters ran after him.

18
00:01:53.027 --> 00:01:55.810
The kittens hid under a table.

19
00:01:55.811 --> 00:02:09.930
"Kittens!" the shopkeeper cried.

20
00:02:09.931 --> 00:02:26.120
He got a broom and swept them outside.

21
00:02:26.121 --> 00:02:31.397
Tom saw some trash in an alley.

22
00:02:31.398 --> 00:02:34.339
"Let's look for food," he said.

23
00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.152
"Then we can go home."

24
00:02:39.153 --> 00:02:41.218
The kittens found some food.

25
00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:47.013
They started to eat.

26
00:02:47.014 --> 00:02:49.301
Woof! Woof!

27
00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:55.831
"Oh no!" Mittens cried. "Dogs!"

28
00:02:55.832 --> 00:03:02.861
"Grr! Grr!" Two dogs growled at the kittens.

29
00:03:02.862 --> 00:03:07.168
The dogs stepped closer.

30
00:03:07.169 --> 00:03:11.584
The three kittens shook with fear.
